  "evidence": [
    "Verified mastera14474869 freshbuild-w7tx6x3m links; all176objects correspond to reviewed upstream-owner candidate. CPPcensus2842/5581 after moving original634330 into genuine zlib component, not losing coverage. Current controls:NetDaemon5exact/68mapped,DiploWin26/50,DiploPop20/38,WorldWin13/27. All old exact and nonexact/refused observations and historical claims remain obligations.",
    "The earlier NetDaemon screen lost original634330 because that function was wrongly owned by the application compilation unit. The positive zlib1.0.2 ownership migration is now integrated: unchanged upstream C owns that identity/claim, actual selected library/caller targets are independently checked, and NetDaemon CPP no longer duplicates it. This is new supported scope/context for one migrated-owner screen, not a blind repeat, demotion or exception. Version-target strictUNKNOWN, dependency failures and EH/FPO obligations remain unwaived.",
    "Fresh read-only triage identifies21DiploWin,14DiploPop,11WorldWin original-frame/current-frameless misses, with genuine existing signatures:442510DiploWin::on_left_click,440550DiploPop::on_iface_button_clicked,4C3E50WorldWin::on_left_click. NetDaemon531020lock_veh remains the controlled representative. Names/adjacency do not prove original TUs or library policy. Exclude repeated WorldWin tile_to_pixel source-spelling trials; no structural/type change is yet supported by this triage.",
    "CPPfiles are private diagnostic overlays ONLY. Exactly4compiler attempts per owner: actual Release full-COFF calibration, unchanged overlay replica, throw-at-entry body-damage witness, one/Oy-candidate. Separate coordinator-owned provisioned leases; freeze root source/Git/preparation. No Debug recipes, extra flags/trials, global/default/inlining/linker/measurement changes, new byte claims or productCPP/header edits. An existing exact loss blocks adoption; preserve any necessary structural discovery through native journal/scope expansion instead of hiding it.",
    "Production CMake may add only source-specific/Oy-for qualifying owners. Consolidate the six superseded metadata-only profile tests into recovery/tests/test_application_compiler_profiles.py in the same step, preserving every prior positive profile, default Win/Technology negative control, exact settled measurement policy/unit overrides, and missing-profile/extra-owner mutations. Replace obsolete NetDaemon-default expectations only if its new qualified profile is adopted. New guard must compare complete source-property multiset to immutable task baseline plus exactly the adopted new block and reject deletion, duplicate/changed options, extra owners and global/default flags. Do not drop assertions to obtain a pass, retain dead test files/imports, reset historical task baselines, weaken a native gate or add a new project CLI.",
    "Before manual integration require fresh full build/link and exact probe correspondence, complete183owner observations, all176physicalobjects including outside helpers/EH with failures visible, strict original/reference checks with unknown/failures retained, selectedMAP/PE/COFF and lifetime/callee review, native source/claim/reference checks and relevant behavioral tests, independent review, fresh destination recheck and cleanup of fullymergedworker. Complete linked retention/structure/runtime/game acceptance remains unproved; this manual route does not alter automatic refusal conditions."
  ],
